# Billing — Signup registrations (UC-110, UC-127)
# Reserved before the tenant exists, so the Google sub, tax id and terms never travel through
# Pub/Sub or the audit log. Tenant-less route under /internal/*, InternalApiGuard only.
#
# Prerequisites:
#   1. pnpm infra:up
#   2. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run dev
#
# REST Client environment: select "local" in VS Code status bar

@baseUrl     = {{backendUrl}}
@internalKey = {{$dotenv INTERNAL_API_KEY}}

### Self-signup (BFF). trialAvailable false => no row was inserted and registrationId is null.
### Billing checks, before the lock and before writing anything: the country (BR only, otherwise
### 422 SIGNUP_COUNTRY_NOT_SUPPORTED), the terms version (the current SIGNUP_TERMS_VERSION, otherwise
### 422 SIGNUP_TERMS_NOT_ACCEPTED) and the tax id (422 SIGNUP_TAX_ID_REQUIRED / SIGNUP_TAX_ID_INVALID).
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/registrations
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "SELF_SIGNUP",
  "googleSub": "112233445566778899001",
  "taxId": "529.982.247-25",
  "countryCode": "BR",
  "terms": { "version": "2026-11" }
}

###

### Operator (scripts/provision-tenant.sh): no lock, no eligibility check, always a fresh row.
### First step of every operator provisioning: take the returned registrationId and send it to
### POST /internal/tenants (../platform/internal-tenants.http). The tax id is optional (the operator is
### trusted); without one the manager types it in the billing page.
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/registrations
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "OPERATOR",
  "taxId": "11.222.333/0001-81",
  "countryCode": "BR"
}

###

### Operator, exempt (free partner or test tenant): no tax id needed; the Billing handler creates an
### ACTIVE, exempt subscription from this registration. Refused for SELF_SIGNUP (400).
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/registrations
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "OPERATOR",
  "exempt": true
}

###

### Invalid: exempt on a self-signup → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/registrations
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "SELF_SIGNUP",
  "googleSub": "1088000000000000001",
  "terms": { "version": "2026-11-01" },
  "exempt": true
}

###

### Invalid: a self-signup without terms → 422 SIGNUP_TERMS_NOT_ACCEPTED
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/registrations
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "SELF_SIGNUP", "googleSub": "112233445566778899001" }

###

### Invalid: a self-signup without googleSub → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/registrations
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "SELF_SIGNUP", "terms": { "version": "2026-11-01" } }

###

### Invalid: a CPF with bad check digits → 422 SIGNUP_TAX_ID_INVALID
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/registrations
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "OPERATOR", "taxId": "111.111.111-11", "countryCode": "BR" }

###

### Missing internal key → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "OPERATOR" }

###

### Invalid: a taxId without countryCode → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/registrations
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "OPERATOR", "taxId": "529.982.247-25" }

###

### Read-only eligibility behind GET /v1/public/signup/session (UC-127). Takes no lock and inserts
### nothing. existingTenantSlug is the earliest unpaid tenant of this Google sub, or null.
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/registrations/eligibility?googleSub=112233445566778899001
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

###

### Release a RESERVED self-signup registration (replace the id with a registrationId from above).
### Idempotent: an unknown, already released or COMPLETED registration answers { "released": false }
### and nothing is deleted.
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/registrations/00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000000/release
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
